have a final next week, you have to deal with it, you are

00:04:56.740 --> 00:04:59.990
not going to ask somebody. I mean you can ask for help but

00:04:59.990 --> 00:05:03.740
at the end of the day it's you who is going to go there and

00:05:03.740 --> 00:05:07.240
write the exam so it's you, you have to fix it, it's not the

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:10.240
